language sdl-mvp1-exercise version 0.1.

unit CompositionManager.
capability StableUiContext.
functionality CreateCompositionScope.
functionality ShareRepresentationReferences.
functionality DisposeCompositionScope.

UIRuntime contains CompositionManager.
CompositionManager provides StableUiContext.
CompositionManager status proposed.
CompositionManager cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/Domains/UIDomain/DetailedDesignDiscussion.md".
CompositionManager owns CreateCompositionScope.
CreateCompositionScope realizes StableUiContext.
CreateCompositionScope specifies "Create context-owned Representation instances/references; never equate semantic type with global singleton.".
CompositionManager owns ShareRepresentationReferences.
ShareRepresentationReferences realizes StableUiContext.
ShareRepresentationReferences specifies "Two locations reference one Representation and its subscription; mounting does not decide domain event handling.".
CompositionManager owns DisposeCompositionScope.
DisposeCompositionScope realizes StableUiContext.
DisposeCompositionScope specifies "Release only owned references/subscriptions after last use; view replacement does not destroy shared semantic context.".
